      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should not ignore chest pain that occurs during physical exertion, as it can still be a warning sign of a serious heart problem even if your meal was spicy. While reflux can be triggered by movement, self-treating with extra-strength antacids without a medical evaluation is dangerous if the underlying cause is cardiac. Please call your doctor or a healthcare provider immediately to discuss your symptoms before taking any additional medication.",
